  "body": "21 Kurahaupo Street presents an exciting opportunity to secure a foothold in one of Auckland's most sought-after suburbs. \r\n\r\nPositioned on the Orakei ridgeline, this elevated weatherboard home offers buyers the chance to add value in a location where future potential is firmly underpinned by surrounding quality homes and ongoing development. \r\n\r\nCurrently configured as a two-bedroom, one-bathroom home, the property will appeal to those looking to renovate and modernise, extend to suit their needs, landbank for the future, or explore the possibilities offered by the Residential Mixed Housing Urban zoning. \r\n\r\nLocation is always key, and this address delivers. Enjoy easy access to the Orakei Basin walkways, Mission Bay's vibrant waterfront, Eastridge Shopping Centre, public transport links and motorway access to Auckland CBD. \r\n\r\nFamilies will also appreciate the sought-after school zoning, including Orakei School and Selwyn College. \r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for your next renovation project, a development opportunity, or a strategic landholding in a premium Auckland suburb, this is a property worthy of your attention. \r\n\r\nBring your vision, roll up your sleeves, and reap the rewards of securing a property in one of Auckland's most tightly held coastal suburbs. \r\n\r\nViewing by appointment only.",
